# Bifrost Portal Code Style

No comments in code. No section dividers. No JSDoc.
Types in `*.types.ts`. Constants in `*.const.ts`. Numbers in `numbers.const.ts`.
Prefer `import type`. No `any`. No `export default` except tooling entry files.
Barrel `index.ts` in every folder.

User-facing copy through `useI18n()` / `Messages`. Never name competitor CMS products.

Pink `#EA0A8E` is the only accent. Body, borders, and canvases stay neutral gray/white (and dark-mode neutrals).

CSS prefix: `Bp-` (BEM). Bear for buttons and the API Explorer grid (`GridTable`). Compass for routing. Synapse for search state.

This site is public docs, not the CMS admin.
